What kind of dreams would I accumulate...

00:26:02.050 --> 00:26:11.000
...what kind of love would I go through...

00:26:12.610 --> 00:26:22.800
 ...if I were to reach that light ?

00:26:38.350 --> 00:26:43.300
Preview of Next Episode

00:26:38.940 --> 00:26:41.160
The Alliance's full-frontal assault finally begins.

00:26:41.160 --> 00:26:44.720
As Reinhard detects the enemy's intention he effectively uses his small fleet to his advantage...

00:26:44.720 --> 00:26:46.250
...and steadily accumulates
battlefield accomplishments.

00:26:46.250 --> 00:26:49.880
On the other hand, Schenkopp lures
Luneberg into one-on-one combat...

00:26:49.880 --> 00:26:52.780
...in the confusion of the battlefield in order
to put an end to the battle between them.

00:26:52.780 --> 00:26:55.740
While all this was happening,
an obituary arrives at Iserlohn.

00:26:56.350 --> 00:26:58.230
Next episode of Legend
of Galactic Heroes Gaiden...

